ATTRIBUTION & UPSTREAM LICENSING

This skill aggregates and distills guidance from the open agent-skill ecosystem. The
underlying technical facts, APIs, and best practices they document are public knowledge;
their expression here was distilled to common rules. Original authors credited in
README.md — haidrrrry, Meet-Miyani, piyushverma0, skydoves, chrisbanes, krshmbb, Drjacky,
13krub, rezaiyan, Google (android/skills), devsemih, AbhijeetBabar, krutikJain — each under
their repository's original license. Portions derived from Apple Human Interface Guidelines
and Android developer documentation remain the property of Apple Inc. / Google LLC and are
summarized as factual guidance under fair-use principles. If you represent an upstream
project and want changes, open an issue and it will be honored promptly.
